  "text": "Contact Us｜MICRONICS JAPAN CO.,LTD. Site search JP EN Contact Us News About Us About Us President's Message Messages from our founder Corporate Philosophy Company Profile / Organization / Officers Our Business Governance Domestic and International Locations About MJC History Products・Service Products・Service Products Semiconductor Products Probe Card Wafer Prober Accessories / Options and Maintenance Parts Semiconductor Test Equipment (IC Tester) Test Socket FPD Products Probe Unit Service Support Product specification changes and discontinued products Sustainability Sustainability MJC's Sustainability Sustainability Initiatives Materiality (Priority Issues) Targets and Results Integrated Management System ESG Data Environment Climate Change Initiatives Environmental Activities Society Product Safety and Quality / Customer Satisfaction Supply Chain Management Human Rights Initiatives Human Capital Diversity Promotion Human Resource Development Health and Productivity Management Occupational Safety and Health Community and Regional Activities Governance Corporate Governance Compliance Risk Management Shareholder and Investor Relations Shareholder and Investor Relations Management Policy & Strategy IR Library Performance & Financial Data Stock Information IR Calendar FAQs Disclaimers Contact Us Contact Us Top Contact Us MICRONICS JAPAN CO., LTD. (collectively, “MJC,” the “Company,” “we,” or “us” or “our”) welcomes your feedback, requests, and inquiries about our products, affiliate products, technologies, IR information, and employment opportunities. Before submitting your inquiry, please read the \"Important information about submitting inquiries\" section. STEP 1 Enter inquiry details STEP 2 Confirm details STEP 3 Submit inquiry Please read the \"Important information about submitting inquiries\" section before submitting your inquiry. Purpose of inquiry required Please select Product / Maintenance Investor Relations Other Product name required Probe Card Wafer Prober Accessories / Options and Maintenance Parts for Wafer Prober Semiconductor Test Equipment (IC Tester) Probe Unit Test Sockets Subject of inquiry required Estimate / quotations Specifications Maintenance Other Country / Region required Group / Organization name required Name required Telephone number required E-mail address required Query required Important information about submitting inquiries Confirm Important information about submitting inquiries Personal information you provide will be used to answer your inquiry/question and to help shape our future activities. Please refer to Privacy Policy regarding our handling of personal information. Please note that it may take some time for us to get back to you with an appropriate response (any inquiry submitted on Saturday, Sunday, public holidays will be dealt with on or after the following business day) and in some cases we may not be able to answer your inquiry. Please do not use our response to your inquiry for purposes other than the inquiry itself without our permission. Customers under 16 years of age need consent from their guardian when making an inquiry. We may not be able to respond to you due to reasons such as an error in the email address you entered or system failure. After your inquiry has been submitted, an automated confirmation email will be sent to you. Please note that if you are using a webmail address (e.g.: Yahoo, Gmail, etc) or a portal site email address, our reply may be filtered into your junk mail box by your email service provider. I have read and acknowledge the above. News About Us President's Message Messages from our founder Corporate Philosophy Company Profile / Organization / Officers Our Business Governance Domestic and International Locations About MJC History Glossary Virtual Patent Marking Event Calendar FAQs Products・Service Products Semiconductor Products Probe Card Wafer Prober Accessories / Options and Maintenance Parts Semiconductor Test Equipment (IC Tester) 